<title>USA: Square weighing strategic alternatives.</title>
<headline>Square weighing strategic alternatives.</headline>
<dateline>JERSEY CITY, N.J. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Square Industries Inc said on Tuesday it was exploring through its financial adviser, The Blackstone Group, various financial and strategic alternatives to maximize shareholder value.</p>
<p>President Brett Harwood said the company expects &quot;a material improvement in the company's operating results for the current quarter which ends Sept 30, 1996 as compared with the results for the three months ended Sept 30, 1995.&quot;</p>
<p>The expectation is based on results that include the commencement of operations at the company's Rockefeller Center Parking Garage in July 1996.</p>
<p>	  -- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
